{"title":"Bolt","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Crafted (Bowyer Lv 1) · Monster drop: Dune Skirmisher, Dune Skirmisher, Dune Marauder, Dune Raider, Dune Sandlord</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      <p><b>Crafted</b> with Bowyer at level 1 <span class=\"muted\">(47 XP)</span> from 1× <a href=\"#/item/pine-wood\">Pine Wood</a>, 2× <a href=\"#/item/feather\">Feather</a>.</p>\n      \n      \n      <div style=\"margin-top:10px\"><b>Recorded monster drops</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"dune-skirmisher\" title=\"Dune Skirmisher - Normal, 14.1% of recorded drops (132 / 935 events)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/dbfd07e1b3cf612d0e3f.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Dune Skirmisher</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">14.1%</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink elite\" data-monster=\"dune-skirmisher\" title=\"Dune Skirmisher - Elite, 45.5% of recorded drops (5 / 11 events)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/dbfd07e1b3cf612d0e3f.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Dune Skirmisher</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">45.5%</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"dune-marauder\" title=\"Dune Marauder - Normal, 1.4% of recorded drops (2 / 142 events)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/9bef3010fbd730cd4612.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Dune Marauder</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1.4%</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"dune-raider\" title=\"Dune Raider - Normal, 20.0% of recorded drops (1 / 5 events)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/df6ebb3872ba169f9ab2.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Dune Raider</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">20.0%</span></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip-row-more-btn\" data-label=\"+1 more\">+1 more</button><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra monsterlink\" data-monster=\"dune-sandlord\" title=\"Dune Sandlord - Normal, 25.0% of recorded drops (1 / 4 events)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/ac5f18074f5b3b49e5cf.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Dune Sandlord</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">25.0%</span></div></div><div class=\"s muted\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">Share of logged loot events from this monster, not a per-kill chance.</div></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"item\" data-map-id=\"bolt\">Show where to get it on the map</button>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/bowyer\">Bowyer</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/herblore\">Herblore</a></p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Related</h2><p class=\"rel-row\"><b>Made from</b> <a class=\"rel-chip\" href=\"#/item/pine-wood\"><img class=\"q-mini\" src=\"data/img/ed4497dc146bd38c40c7.svg\" alt=\"\">Pine Wood</a><a class=\"rel-chip\" href=\"#/item/feather\"><img class=\"q-mini\" src=\"data/img/562fb3c64f2d6db1b6fa.svg\" alt=\"\">Feather</a></p>\n      <h2>Used to make</h2><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li><a href=\"#/item/bodkin-bolt\">Bodkin Bolt</a> <span class=\"muted\">· Bowyer 10</span></li><li><a href=\"#/item/weak-poisoned-bolt\">Weak Poisoned Bolt</a> <span class=\"muted\">· Herblore 30</span></li><li><a href=\"#/item/poisoned-bolt\">Poisoned Bolt</a> <span class=\"muted\">· Herblore 50</span></li><li><a href=\"#/item/potent-poisoned-bolt\">Potent Poisoned Bolt</a> <span class=\"muted\">· Herblore 70</span></li></ul>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic \"><img src=\"data/img/b4362887a1f8d7b3462f.svg\" alt=\"Bolt\"></div><h3>Bolt</h3><table>\n      \n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Made with</th><td>Bowyer 1</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Dropped by</th><td>4 monsters</td></tr>\n      \n      <tr><th>Used in</th><td>4 recipes</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Last seen</th><td>10/6/2026, 8:15:25 AM</td><